UID:2026-10-03-halfway-to-st-patricks-day-9ebba63@norwood.ma
DTSTAMP:20260929T165033Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261003T120000
SUMMARY:Halfway to St. Patricks Day
DESCRIPTION:Oct 3 Halfway to St. Patricks Day Saturday\, October 3\, 2026 12:00 PM 11:00 PM South Boston Taproom (map) Google Calendar ICS Irish Music\, Green Beer\, Food Specials...what more can Southie ask for We couldn't wait for the best day of the year...so we are throwing ourselves. If you’re craving wearing green and drinking beer\, we’ve got the perfect event for you! It’s the Half-Way to St. Patrick’s Day Party! Enjoy live Irish music\, specials from Bardo’s and plenty o’ green beer! All-day event Forfoc\nSource: https://www.castleislandbeer.com/calendar/halfway-to-st-patricks-day
URL:https://www.castleislandbeer.com/calendar/halfway-to-st-patricks-day
END:VEVENT
